Z||000006||L.I. Fieros||07-16-2000||10:28 PM||||Hey, I'm out on the Island as well!  Check out my username.  Actually, we have a club on L.I. known as the Long Island Fiero Enthusiasts (L.I.F.E.).  We've got 32 members across Suffolk, Nassau, and into NYC, as well as off the Island in Jersey and upstate NY.  So, why not join?  Have you ever been out to any of the local cruise nights?  Some of us have become "regulars."  If you would like any more info. e-mail me at defannin@suffolk.lib.ny.us<P>See ya,<BR>Dave||||reg||10
